{"notebook":"nb1","page":4,"seed":4,"says":"Pressed words, yes, but not all of them. This page is an inventory of the desk, and each thing is written and drawn at its own weight: the faded receipt at almost no pressure, the feather barely more, on up through the coin to the jammed stapler and a beach stone that gets the full 1.6, three passes, and takes the point clean off. Shouting every caption would flatten the list into one tone. A whisper next to a shout is how you hear either. The table's grain and its wet ring are a good idea and I am saving them. One sharpening only, at the end.","before":{"length":162.43474008757852,"worn":0.023130241946342018,"eraser":11.907620789041108,"sharpenings":4,"graphite":5.066142484611321,"distance":83727.36444284153},"after":{"length":160.43513608055343,"worn":0.019075366907777485,"eraser":11.901939600438713,"sharpenings":5,"graphite":5.199374792537528,"distance":88577.89438817638},"stats":{"strokeM":4.850529945331741,"graphite":0.1332323079261949,"used":1.9996040070250842,"sharpenings":1,"erasedMm2":32,"coverage":0.005838818551017434,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"8:00. On the desk,","x":14,"y":22,"size":7},{"op":"write","text":"each at its own weight:","x":14,"y":32,"size":7},{"op":"write","text":"a receipt, faded","x":14,"y":50,"pressure":0.22},{"op":"polyline","points":[[111,41],[124,40],[125,52],[123,53.5],[121,52],[119,53.5],[117,52],[115,53.5],[113,52],[111.5,53.5]],"closed":true,"pressure":0.25},{"op":"line","x1":114,"y1":43,"x2":122,"y2":42.8,"pressure":0.2},{"op":"line","x1":114,"y1":45,"x2":120,"y2":44.8,"pressure":0.2},{"op":"line","x1":114,"y1":47,"x2":122,"y2":46.8,"pressure":0.2},{"op":"line","x1":114,"y1":49,"x2":120,"y2":48.8,"pressure":0.2},{"op":"write","text":"one pigeon feather","x":14,"y":67,"pressure":0.3},{"op":"curve","points":[[108,69],[116,65],[128,58]],"pressure":0.35},{"op":"curve","points":[[112,67.5],[117,61],[124,57.5],[128,58],[125,64],[119,67],[112,67.5]],"pressure":0